<section id="process"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker reveal">Process</p><h2 class="reveal">Four days from steel to sleeve.</h2>
  <div class="steps reveal">
    <article><span class="n">01 / DIE</span><h3>Cut the steel</h3><p>Line art is tuned for draft angles, engraved into hardened tool steel, heat-treated overnight.</p></article>
    <article><span class="n">02 / STRIKE</span><h3>Hit it twice</h3><p>Blanks are annealed and struck twice at 60 tonnes so relief fills into the corners.</p></article>
    <article><span class="n">03 / REED</span><h3>Mill the edge</h3><p>120 reeds rolled into the collar — the part nobody photographs and the first thing your thumb finds.</p></article>
    <article><span class="n">04 / FINISH</span><h3>Antique &amp; number</h3><p>Oxide by hand, relieve the high points, laser the serial, seal, sleeve, ship.</p></article>
  </div>
</div></section>

